# 100% Automated Deployment — No Credentials Needed!
#
# All accounts are created automatically using temporary email addresses.
# No manual signup, no API keys, no personal credentials required.
#
# Just run:
#   cd scripts/deploy_setup
#   python3 run_all.py
#
# The script will:
#   1. Create temp emails for all platforms
#   2. Sign up on Neon, Upstash, GitHub, Render, UptimeRobot
#   3. Verify emails automatically
#   4. Configure all services
#   5. Deploy your dashboard
#
# Estimated time: 10-15 minutes
# Results will be saved to deploy_results.json
